    idealAnswer: '• Shadow Deployment: Live production traffic is mirrored asynchronously to the new model candidate. Predictions are logged and evaluated against the existing model without being returned to users. Zero user risk, but doubles compute costs.\n• Canary Release: Small slice of live traffic (e.g. 5%) is routed to the new candidate. If latency, error rates, and business metrics stay healthy, traffic is incrementally increased (10% -> 25% -> 100%).\n• Blue/Green Deployment: Two identical production environments (Blue = live v1, Green = idle v2). After smoke testing Green, the load balancer switches 100% of traffic instantly. Enables instantaneous rollback if issues arise.',
